WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.429 --> 00:00:04.652
Unit twenty-one. Playing Online Games Safely!

2
00:00:05.607 --> 00:00:10.324
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.374 --> 00:00:13.340
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:17.806
Today we learn about Playing Online Games Safely. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.900
Game. Say it with me. Game!

6
00:00:26.373 --> 00:00:30.402
Online. Say it with me. Online!

7
00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:37.604
Player. Say it with me. Player!

8
00:00:41.105 --> 00:00:44.805
Chat. Say it with me. Chat!

9
00:00:48.375 --> 00:00:52.575
Username. Say it with me. Username!

10
00:00:56.025 --> 00:00:59.890
Stranger. Say it with me. Stranger!

11
00:01:03.391 --> 00:01:07.225
Kind. Say it with me. Kind!

12
00:01:10.701 --> 00:01:14.514
Time. Say it with me. Time!

13
00:01:18.055 --> 00:01:30.675
When I play an online game, I use a username that does not show my real name. I do not chat with a stranger or share information. I play kindly and stop when my time is up.

14
00:01:30.725 --> 00:01:33.940
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:34.683 --> 00:01:40.089
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:40.139 --> 00:01:41.289
Player!

17
00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:47.881
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.931 --> 00:01:49.081
Kind!

19
00:01:49.952 --> 00:01:56.112
Did you know? Many games let a grown-up turn off chat to keep children safer!

20
00:01:56.162 --> 00:01:58.686
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:59.536 --> 00:02:08.155
Think and answer. Why should your username not be your real name?

22
00:02:08.205 --> 00:02:09.355
Great answer!

23
00:02:10.498 --> 00:02:16.520
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:19.894
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

